{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-xiapan-media#card-zh","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-xiapan-media","commit":"7a60a4be4353892a7facefc77699ed92552948f4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-xiapan-media 是面向 DSH 的媒体插件包，包含视觉模型路由、图片工具和视频工具三个可独立安装的插件。视觉路由把会话中的图片转成文字描述后交给原文本模型继续回答，也提供图片理解、OCR 和控件定位工具；图片工具可按提示生成图片或依据工作区参考图编辑图片；视频工具支持文生视频和图生视频，并将结果保存为工作区文件。图片和视频生成使用虾盘云模型 API，调用凭据通过 DSH 凭据引用、环境变量或设备凭据解析；生成工具默认要求调用前批准。适合希望在 DSH 会话中识图、制作图片或生成短视频的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["vision.js:26-46","vision.js:86-91","image.js:30-50","video.js:33-54","lib/shared.mjs:23-40"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-xiapan-media#card-en","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-xiapan-media","commit":"7a60a4be4353892a7facefc77699ed92552948f4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-xiapan-media adds vision, image generation, and video generation to DSH. It converts session images to text, offers OCR, creates or edits workspace pictures, and generates short videos from prompts or a starting frame. Media requests use Xiapan Cloud APIs and request approval by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["vision.js:26-46","vision.js:86-91","image.js:30-50","video.js:33-54","lib/shared.mjs:23-40"]}
